{"server":"tw","storyId":"act13d5_level_act13d5_06_end","groupId":"act13d5","stageId":"act13d5_06","title":"藍耳酒窖","storyCode":"MN-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"7cb0f5f180c90e1dfdf9260606754683f26f8b642b83447284728ef64d7f197b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"佐菲婭久違地來到酒吧，得知瑪莉婭的對手後大感驚訝——同時，左手騎士無匹的實力令瑪莉婭陷入絕境。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔 6下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"前一任白金大位對目標暗生情愫，為了保護他的意中人而死在了其他無胄盟成員的手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"結果而言，如今的這位小姑娘被匆匆推上了這個位置，“最年輕的白金”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"......雖然的確是天才般的射手，真要論實力倒也不至於才不配位......不過其他方面遠不如其他大位成熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是這樣......您為什麼要和我說這些？無胄盟的存在應該是個機密......您該不會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，別這麼想，只是我最近時常在回想這件事。如果我沒有努力到今天這個位置，我連思考這件事的權力都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎？最後推舉如今的白金成為白金的，正是瀕死前的上一任白金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"這就很耐人尋味了......且不說為什麼無胄盟要聽一個叛徒的話，何況推舉這個小姑娘也改變不了他的死局，他為什麼要這麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"在他被同僚的弓箭貫穿胸膛之前，他是不是想過要嘶吼什麼呢？對誰？說什麼？他想做到什麼？只是那麼簡單嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得您是斯沃瑪公司的員工，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是的......賽事期間，我負責和其他各大公司以及騎士協會交接任務......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"跑腿，很辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有的事，能為企業做出貢獻，是我應該做的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，你的工作是為你的薪水準備的，別說這麼卑微的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾經似乎有過創業的記錄，為什麼沒有堅持到底呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......那是因為我能力不足......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"決定成敗的也許不只是能力。你可能選錯了路，否則你也許會和我平起平坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"就、就我這種人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"在卡西米爾，皆有可能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"佐菲婭......很久沒看見過你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬丁叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瑪莉婭她來過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"出了點事情，我們讓她回家裡去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——有血的味道，等等，這些繃帶是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭受傷了？她的對手是誰？發生了什麼！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都讓她不要急著繼續參賽，這個丫頭怎麼就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜點，受傷的是另一個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫騎士和焰尾騎士遭到了某些人的襲擊......灰毫負了傷，她們恰好躲避到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"今天早上，她們說著不想再給臨光添麻煩之類的話就離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......會有這麼巧的事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"她們的處境很危險，但我們愛莫能助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"看了今天早上的新聞了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭現在在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"比賽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼比賽？對手是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"和英格拉一樣的無保護一對一，單挑賽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"對手是“左手”泰特斯·白楊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等——誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"鋒盔騎士團主將，貴族騎士，高級商業騎士，曾到十六強止步的競技騎士，泰特斯·白楊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可.....可是瑪莉婭這個積分段無論如何也不會和他匹配到一起啊，他的身價甚至......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"有人來找過瑪莉婭，是個不好對付的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的她就像是過去的瑪嘉烈一樣，一門心思往前衝，她可不懂怎麼和企業家們打交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......她和瑪嘉烈一樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪嘉烈知道自己在做什麼，她只是一廂情願地篤定了自己的理想才變成那樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭她都不清楚自己面對的是什麼，也不知道該怎麼做。再這樣往上爬，實在是太危險了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少瑪莉婭本來可以過上更輕鬆的生活......她不用變成你我這樣的競技騎士，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"也許你說的對，但是她是不是有自己的覺悟，你不該妄下判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"她還很年輕，也很不安，她那副輕鬆的態度也許都只是為了讓你安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然瑪莉婭經常表現出不成熟的樣子，但是哪一個沒有鬥志的人能夠戰勝塑膠騎士，能和鏽銅打成平手，還能在混戰賽上奪得第三？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許她應該輸一場，清醒一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的這麼想的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪座競技場？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"女士們——先生們！歡迎來到炎刃競技場，歡迎觀看本日的特殊賽事——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"這場比賽已經引起了選拔開始以來最大規模的媒體關注，此時此刻，來自玫瑰報業集團的十二家媒體都將聚焦著這座競技場！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅如此——哦，我們可憐的炎刃競技場，號稱卡西米爾第三大的炎刃競技場！今天！座無虛席！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"是對陣雙方的人氣高至如此嗎？！還是這一戰的確大有看點！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以負責任地告訴大家，答案是——二者皆有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"這是——何等的殊榮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"本日特殊賽事的對戰雙方，一位，是來自臨光家族，如今風頭正盛，讓狂熱者們議論紛紛的美少女騎士——瑪莉婭·臨光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"而另一邊——！斂藏的鋒芒，千萬身價，以過去的傳奇騎士冠名，來自鋒盔騎士團的大紅人“左手”泰特斯·白楊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢噢！這還是第一次在騎士入場之前，獎池就已經累積到了這個數字！！看來我已經沒有反覆囉嗦的必要——你們早就嫌我囉嗦了對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！那麼事不宜遲！有請雙方騎士進入競技場！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"首先進入戰場的是瑪莉婭·臨光！依舊是一身潔白甲胄！依舊是一副楚楚可憐的姿態！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"在戰勝了“塑膠”瑟奇亞克至今，始終高歌猛進，在各個大小賽事都有著出色發揮的瑪莉婭·臨光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"如今登場的她，早已做出了特錦賽名額勢在必得的宣言！她是否能靠這一戰作為踏板，躋身卡西米爾騎士之巔？讓我們拭目以待！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（我明明沒做過呀......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"而另一邊——有請——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴，聒噪的小丑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"你這種人根本不配站在我的賽場上，早點滾下台吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"——沒錯！這就是泰特斯·白楊！我早說了，就該給選手們都裝上麥克風，讓所有觀眾沉浸在他們的廝殺之中！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac13_8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"本場賽事由梅什科集團，玫瑰報業聯合集團，斯沃瑪食品公司，呼嘯守衛公司聯合贊助！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現場觀眾將隨時可能獲得上述公司贈予的商品優惠券！而我個人再次隆重向各位推薦觀賽必備的——藍耳牌啤酒！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"......臨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"真難看，為了保住騎士家族的地位而掙扎的樣子，真像是出水的鉗獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有能力負擔起騎士之名，又何必厚顏無恥地死纏爛打？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......這不是你說了算的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"無所謂，臨光一家最後的騎士今天就會毀在我的手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我和英格拉那個廢物不一樣......我會確實地讓你知道，並非持武器者就能被叫做騎士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"火藥味——！一觸即發的火藥味——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"就連我也不忍心繼續吊大家的胃口了，讓我榮幸地宣佈！競技——開始！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"——發、發生什麼了！？一瞬間！開戰的一瞬間！瑪莉婭的劍就被打飛了！然後重重的一踢——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是巨大的實力差距——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"把劍拿起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（好、好痛......！他是怎麼......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"快點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（槍騎兵......攻擊範圍很遠，而且，靈活，有力.....沒有漏洞。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......再來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"別想得逞——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"孱弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"把光......劈開了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"......很難嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"本打算直接將你的劍也一分為二，哼......臨光家的劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"你握著你的信仰，可你卻對它一無所知。你幼稚，無力，思想軟弱，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"不配做我的對手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"再一次！遊刃有餘的左手騎士！等著瑪莉婭撿起武器，然後又是一發猛擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是卡西米爾頂級騎士團的實力！這就是特錦賽正賽騎士的實力！第一次來到卡西米爾的觀眾朋友們，一刻也不要閉眼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"因為殘酷的勝負，就在一瞬之間！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"光芒被揉皺，摧毀，褻瀆。\n在“左手”泰特斯的陰影前，瑪莉婭再一次舉起了劍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
